  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Wiring contract",
      "items": [
        "createSpeakOrNoSpeak() merges options, builds engine + TurnDetector, and wires frames; the mic opens only in start() (speak-or-no-speak.js:37-59)",
        "App drives start() / stop() / setAgentSpeaking(); the facade delivers onSpeechStart, onTurnEnd, onInterrupt (speak-or-no-speak.js:69-116)",
        "The page loads pinned CDN scripts; the adapter reads window.vad, SmartTurnModel reads window.ort (index.html:109-112, silero-vad-adapter.js:199-208)",
        "MicVAD.new is timeout-guarded (8 s): AudioWorklet hang → documented ScriptProcessor retry (silero-vad-adapter.js:134-177)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Degradation ladder",
      "items": [
        "Silero fails to load (cdn-unavailable / engine-load-failed / audio-pipeline) → EnergyVad takes over; degraded.engine = \"energy\" (speak-or-no-speak.js:78-95)",
        "Mic track without active AEC → stricter barge-in gating: ~300 ms confirm and frame rms > 2× rolling playback baseline (turn-detector.js:196-201)",
        "Smart-turn model error or 300 ms timeout → fail-open: the turn end emits anyway (turn-detector.js:467-474)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Agent flag & real-time discipline",
      "items": [
        "setAgentSpeaking(true) suppresses onTurnEnd/onSpeechStart; confirmed speech fires onInterrupt, 500 ms grace keeps the turn whole (turn-detector.js:187-236)",
        "Turn end = adaptive redemption: redemptionFor() derives 350–1200 ms from the turn's rhythm (turn-detector.js:59-65)",
        "STT lives strictly outside the real-time loop — apps wire adapters to onTurnEnd audio; failures never affect detection (stt-adapter.js:4-13)",
        "npm start serves the zero-build page, ES modules and /vendor/*.onnx on :5173 (package.json:23)"
      ]
    }
  ]
